reason to exist. Tasks `tasks.md` 3.1–3.5; design §8; delta\n`specs/forge/`.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Interface `Item` / `ChangeRequest` / `Check` + exactly four writes (marker label, comment, close item, merge at sha).\n- GitHub: issues, sub-issues for the epic relation, issue dependencies (`blocked_by`), PRs, check runs and commit\n  statuses, `gh pr merge --squash --match-head-commit <sha>`.\n- GitLab: `glab api` items with `related_items` (smaller-number rule), MRs, head pipeline jobs with `allow_failure`,\n  `glab mr merge --sha`.\n- Auth from the CLI's own store only. Bounded per-tick request budget; 401/5xx surfaces as project `stale`.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- Fixture tests per adapter from recorded payloads of `dinhtrung/fleet-console` (GitHub) and `traffic-simulator-v2`\n  (GitLab).\n- The same decide test passes with both adapters.\n- A failing check marked allow-failure does not read red; a docs-only PR with no checks reads green with the reason.\n\n## Evidence in the PR\n\nFixture file names, the two decide runs, and one real `gh api` read.\n\n## Constraints\n\nNo forge token in config, DB or events. No GraphQL unless REST cannot answer (record why).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dinhtrung/fleet-console/issues/5/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dinhtrung/fleet-console/issues/5/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}]